WEBVTT

01:29.170 --> 01:34.390
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.870 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 28]

01:39.920 --> 01:41.310
Come back to me

01:43.710 --> 01:45.570
just like when we were kids, okay?

01:53.350 --> 01:54.000
So, today,

01:54.000 --> 01:55.430
you came to me

01:56.160 --> 01:57.360
to make a deal with me?

01:58.120 --> 01:59.200
Of course, no.

02:00.710 --> 02:02.280
I just want you to see me.

02:05.510 --> 02:07.040
What if I say I don't want to?

02:12.670 --> 02:13.360
Jiang Yan.

02:14.310 --> 02:15.590
I love Lu Xixiao

02:15.610 --> 02:17.060
not because he helped me.

02:18.840 --> 02:20.280
I don't need to

02:21.360 --> 02:22.360
give him something in return

02:22.360 --> 02:24.020
for him doing anything for me.

02:25.520 --> 02:26.310
If you

02:26.310 --> 02:27.520
give me the evidence

02:28.030 --> 02:29.190
just to threaten me

02:29.190 --> 02:30.390
into making a choice,

02:33.280 --> 02:34.680
now you know the answer.

02:41.680 --> 02:42.590
Why?

02:46.630 --> 02:47.690
Since we were kids,

02:49.520 --> 02:50.980
since the very beginning,

02:52.000 --> 02:53.400
and since ten years ago,

02:55.430 --> 02:56.829
I told you many times that

02:57.560 --> 02:58.520
I sincerely treated you

02:58.520 --> 03:00.150
as my good friend.

03:03.710 --> 03:05.080
And I

03:05.080 --> 03:06.910
trusted you.

03:08.470 --> 03:10.730
I know that in the accident ten years ago,

03:11.240 --> 03:13.150
it was you who leaked my whereabouts

03:13.150 --> 03:14.280
to Luo He.

03:15.120 --> 03:16.079
But I still believe

03:16.079 --> 03:17.360
you didn't mean it.

03:24.710 --> 03:26.120
Few people knew

03:26.120 --> 03:27.520
I went back to Pingchuan.

03:33.240 --> 03:34.840
I just don't understand why,

03:34.850 --> 03:36.470
even though you know how important

03:36.470 --> 03:38.120
the matter of Director Wang is to me,

03:38.120 --> 03:39.150
you utilize it

03:39.150 --> 03:41.000
to force me to leave Lu Xixiao.

03:41.560 --> 03:42.120
I...

03:53.150 --> 03:55.280
Let's go our separate ways from now on.

04:24.630 --> 04:26.490
Finished talking with Jiang Yan?

04:39.510 --> 04:41.440
The communication didn't go well?

04:44.510 --> 04:45.720
I might not be able to get

04:45.720 --> 04:47.580
the evidence in Jiang Yan's hand.

04:52.000 --> 04:52.680
It's okay.

04:54.510 --> 04:55.510
I found the dealer

04:55.770 --> 04:57.830
who coordinated with Director Wang.

04:58.960 --> 04:59.830
If we have a way

04:59.830 --> 05:01.230
to let him tell the truth,

05:01.960 --> 05:03.360
everything will be fine.

05:05.520 --> 05:06.990
Let's go to him tomorrow.

05:11.810 --> 05:12.940
There's no reward?

05:15.620 --> 05:16.300
What?

05:18.720 --> 05:20.740
You went to see my rival in love

05:20.960 --> 05:21.830
and left me alone

05:21.830 --> 05:23.120
for an hour.

05:24.120 --> 05:25.520
Shouldn't you reward me?

05:26.510 --> 05:28.510
You insisted on coming here.

05:29.190 --> 05:29.920
I don't care.

05:30.680 --> 05:31.410
I'm jealous.

05:31.840 --> 05:32.810
Coax me.

05:50.220 --> 05:50.950
Is it okay?

05:52.120 --> 05:53.000
Stop it.

05:55.400 --> 05:55.960
Go home.

05:57.370 --> 05:58.800
Yes, Ma'am.

06:02.270 --> 06:04.800
I asked you to supervise
the Phase II project.

06:05.070 --> 06:06.680
Why am I the last one

06:06.680 --> 06:09.210
to know about the incident of
Shengshi Huayu?

06:10.000 --> 06:11.190
When I heard the news,

06:11.190 --> 06:12.600
it had already happened.

06:14.020 --> 06:15.510
Why didn't you report to me

06:15.510 --> 06:16.510
at the first time?

06:16.870 --> 06:18.430
Don't you know that Xinghai Entertainment

06:18.430 --> 06:20.070
was introduced by me?

06:20.560 --> 06:22.270
As Shengshi Huayu got involved,

06:22.270 --> 06:24.730
Xinghai Entertainment
would be abandoned.

06:30.310 --> 06:31.480
I remember that

06:32.120 --> 06:34.430
you told me

06:34.480 --> 06:36.610
you needed me, an experienced person,

06:36.980 --> 06:37.680
to take charge of the Phase II project

06:37.680 --> 06:39.600
on behalf of the headquarters.

06:40.120 --> 06:41.510
If anything goes wrong,

06:41.870 --> 06:43.930
I should report to the headquarters.

06:44.270 --> 06:45.600
Based on my experience,

06:46.000 --> 06:46.920
I didn't think

06:46.920 --> 06:48.270
there was anything wrong.

06:48.270 --> 06:49.200
On the contrary,

06:49.600 --> 06:51.400
it will also add to the project.

06:52.360 --> 06:54.360
You've learned to

06:54.360 --> 06:56.630
play the word game with me, huh?

06:57.600 --> 06:58.270
I helped you

06:58.270 --> 06:59.600
get this position.

06:59.600 --> 07:01.750
I can also make you step down.

07:09.560 --> 07:10.360
Mr. Lu,

07:12.870 --> 07:14.190
please help yourself.

07:16.720 --> 07:18.360
Do you still think

07:18.360 --> 07:19.680
I'm the kid who was threatened by you

07:19.680 --> 07:21.940
with several words and at your disposal?

07:26.430 --> 07:27.240
Wait.

07:28.000 --> 07:28.800
My boy,

07:29.720 --> 07:30.870
listen to me.

07:31.750 --> 07:33.040
You're my son.

07:33.040 --> 07:34.430
You are much better

07:34.430 --> 07:36.700
than Lu Xixiao.

07:37.600 --> 07:38.700
Since you treated me like this,

07:38.700 --> 07:40.430
I believe you will do the same to others.

07:40.430 --> 07:42.159
You inherited from me.

07:42.230 --> 07:43.600
If you keep doing this,

07:43.600 --> 07:45.070
one day,

07:45.070 --> 07:46.360
you will make great achievements.

07:46.360 --> 07:47.600
Trust me, baby.

07:47.600 --> 07:48.190
Baby.

08:08.000 --> 08:08.750
Mr. Lu.

08:09.430 --> 08:10.320
Well...

08:10.720 --> 08:12.090
What is it?

08:12.720 --> 08:14.600
Someone saw Xixiao and Zhou Wan

08:14.600 --> 08:16.920
go to Wang Yongli's house together.

08:17.600 --> 08:18.800
Damn it.

08:22.240 --> 08:23.960
Both of the two brats

08:24.830 --> 08:26.360
are

08:26.360 --> 08:27.720
going against me.

08:28.600 --> 08:29.480
Fine.

08:30.870 --> 08:33.520
Zhou Wan is trying to

08:33.600 --> 08:35.080
figure out

08:35.080 --> 08:36.870
what happened back then.

08:42.600 --> 08:43.240
Well...

08:43.240 --> 08:45.570
As for the incident of Yinshan Factory...

08:45.600 --> 08:47.600
I don't need you to remind me of that!

08:51.260 --> 08:52.750
Dad, don't go.

08:53.000 --> 08:55.150
Didn't he promise to help us?

08:55.440 --> 08:57.120
You don't have to hide, right?

09:00.850 --> 09:02.910
The matter hasn't been resolved yet.

09:03.600 --> 09:05.200
I don't want to drag you down.

09:07.390 --> 09:08.840
Take good care of Grandma

09:09.640 --> 09:10.760
and study hard.

09:12.880 --> 09:13.800
Wang Yongli.

09:14.380 --> 09:16.310
Finally, you're home.

09:16.600 --> 09:18.890
Now, you have money
to pay your debt, right?

09:18.890 --> 09:20.300
Give me some more time.

09:21.200 --> 09:21.960
I...

09:22.970 --> 09:24.060
I have no money.

09:24.870 --> 09:27.120
No money? No money?

09:27.870 --> 09:29.390
What's your excuse this time?

09:29.390 --> 09:30.900
Do you think I still trust you?

09:30.900 --> 09:32.360
Lan Yue's men came to you

09:32.360 --> 09:33.930
and gave you food and drinks.

09:33.930 --> 09:35.360
Selling the factory land

09:35.360 --> 09:37.150
must have made you a lot of money, right?

09:37.150 --> 09:38.080
Lan Yue's men?

09:38.960 --> 09:40.610
-Don't play dumb!
-Let go!

09:40.790 --> 09:42.070
Let him go.

09:46.570 --> 09:55.710
[Lan Yue Group, B2]

09:46.680 --> 09:48.630
You've been in the toilet for so long.

09:48.630 --> 09:49.750
The information company sent me

09:49.750 --> 09:50.680
the address.

09:50.960 --> 09:52.150
I'll wait for you in the garage.

09:52.150 --> 09:53.480
Li Xin talked with me just now.

09:53.480 --> 09:54.630
I'm in the elevator.

09:54.630 --> 09:55.510
I'll go downstairs now.

09:55.510 --> 09:56.770
Okay. There's no rush.

09:57.720 --> 09:59.510
Do you want to go there after dinner

09:59.510 --> 10:00.550
or right now?

10:00.570 --> 10:01.630
Go there right now.

10:02.500 --> 10:03.110
Hello?

10:04.150 --> 10:05.840
Hello, Zhou Wan.

10:05.840 --> 10:06.550
Hello?

10:08.270 --> 10:09.960
Zhou Wan. Hello?

10:22.950 --> 10:23.810
Get the three elevators' surveillance

10:23.810 --> 10:25.100
on the first floor of Building A.

10:23.900 --> 10:26.660
[CCTV]

10:28.080 --> 10:28.910
Hurry up!

10:29.270 --> 10:31.150
[CCTV]

10:30.120 --> 10:31.240
These three.

10:32.270 --> 10:34.150
Zoom in.

10:35.010 --> 10:36.910
[CCTV]

10:38.950 --> 10:41.760
[Elevator 8]

10:40.550 --> 10:41.480
Let's go.

10:41.790 --> 10:44.700
[Elevator 8]

10:45.440 --> 10:46.610
It's him!

10:46.660 --> 10:48.260
Director Lu, do you know him?

10:48.330 --> 10:52.710
[CCTV]

10:48.510 --> 10:49.200
The police will be here soon.

10:49.200 --> 10:49.720
Tell them

10:49.720 --> 10:50.870
this person is Wang Yongli.

10:50.870 --> 10:51.270
He was

10:51.270 --> 10:53.270
the director of
Yinshan Furniture Factory.

10:53.270 --> 10:54.000
When the police arrive,

10:54.000 --> 10:55.080
ask them to search

10:55.080 --> 10:55.790
the surroundings of the Jinsha Bay

10:55.790 --> 10:56.940
and Yinshan Furniture Factory.

10:56.710 --> 10:59.880
[CCTV]

10:57.000 --> 10:57.630
Director Lu.

10:57.630 --> 10:58.630
Aren't you waiting for the police?

10:58.630 --> 10:59.760
Where are you going?

10:59.980 --> 11:01.500
[Elevator 8]

11:01.720 --> 11:02.980
Did something happen?

11:03.270 --> 11:05.040
Get out of my sight.

11:05.550 --> 11:07.410
Did something happen to Zhou Wan?

11:09.290 --> 11:10.630
How dare you ask me this question?

11:10.630 --> 11:11.960
Wang Yongli took Zhou Wan away.

11:11.960 --> 11:13.090
It's all your fault.

11:14.120 --> 11:15.760
Get in. I'll go with you.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.930
There are not many places
where Wang Yongli can hide.

11:18.930 --> 11:19.940
I've checked.

11:19.960 --> 11:21.080
He was hiding in

11:21.080 --> 11:22.030
the old building of Yinshan Factory.

11:22.030 --> 11:24.080
I know where it is. Hurry up!

11:46.870 --> 11:47.600
Lu Xixiao,

11:48.440 --> 11:50.360
as for Luo He's incident ten years ago,

11:50.360 --> 11:51.450
I'm sorry.

11:51.790 --> 11:53.660
I cared too much about
my family background.

11:53.660 --> 11:55.590
That's why I keep making mistakes.

11:56.960 --> 11:57.960
What's wrong with you?

11:57.960 --> 11:59.690
Why are you telling me this now?

12:00.470 --> 12:01.910
I hated Lu Zhongyue

12:01.910 --> 12:02.910
and resented you.

12:03.480 --> 12:04.930
But it doesn't matter now.

12:04.930 --> 12:06.320
Let bygones be bygones.

12:07.390 --> 12:07.960
If you hadn't wasted the time

12:07.960 --> 12:08.840
saying these words to me,

12:08.840 --> 12:10.040
we would be there now.

12:10.950 --> 12:11.620
Jiang Yan,

12:12.030 --> 12:13.510
you've loved Zhou Wan
for so many years.

12:13.510 --> 12:14.000
Have you ever

12:14.000 --> 12:15.400
protected her even once?

12:16.320 --> 12:16.960
Listen.

12:16.960 --> 12:18.120
If anything happens to Zhou Wan today,

12:18.120 --> 12:19.920
you'll never be able to repay it.

12:22.480 --> 12:23.750
Yes, it's my fault.

12:24.550 --> 12:25.320
I just can't

12:27.290 --> 12:28.210
accept that

12:28.240 --> 12:29.750
you are always prior to me

12:30.350 --> 12:31.830
in everyone's eyes.

12:33.750 --> 12:35.410
You have a better background.

12:35.750 --> 12:36.810
Zhou Wan loves you.

12:37.000 --> 12:38.130
Grandpa values you.

12:38.870 --> 12:40.030
Even Lu Zhongyue

12:40.030 --> 12:41.230
thinks highly of you.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.030
But I never meant

12:44.030 --> 12:45.030
-to hurt Zhou Wan.
-Enough.

12:45.030 --> 12:46.320
Stop talking nonsense.

12:46.320 --> 12:47.960
Can you just drive?

13:13.000 --> 13:13.720
Lu Xixiao.

13:15.080 --> 13:15.910
There are many buildings here.

13:15.910 --> 13:16.960
Let's split up.

13:29.000 --> 13:29.800
You're awake.

13:30.960 --> 13:32.620
Do you know what this place is?

13:39.750 --> 13:41.280
Yinshan Furniture Factory

13:41.600 --> 13:43.340
moved to Jinsha Bay.

13:43.750 --> 13:45.510
The factory you founded

13:46.150 --> 13:47.910
was

13:48.240 --> 13:50.440
near the raw material production site.

13:53.450 --> 13:54.560
You know what?

13:55.360 --> 13:56.280
Back then,

13:57.550 --> 13:58.790
I bought this land

13:59.840 --> 14:00.750
and made

14:01.200 --> 14:02.720
every piece of furniture

14:02.720 --> 14:03.870
together with my men.

14:03.870 --> 14:06.360
Then, we had the opportunity to
expand the business.

14:06.360 --> 14:07.150
Later,

14:07.840 --> 14:09.690
I bought this place.

14:11.440 --> 14:11.970
But then,

14:13.150 --> 14:15.940
I got a failure

14:16.350 --> 14:17.870
and ended up like this.

14:18.960 --> 14:20.150
I can only hide here.

14:20.900 --> 14:22.150
And all this

14:22.590 --> 14:24.100
is Lu Zhongyue's fault.

14:24.780 --> 14:26.040
I understand.

14:26.220 --> 14:27.480
I totally understand.

14:27.870 --> 14:28.960
Lili must have told you

14:28.960 --> 14:30.090
what happened to me.

14:30.450 --> 14:32.150
Lu Zhongyue used the same trick

14:32.150 --> 14:33.720
to frame my dad's factory,

14:34.400 --> 14:35.830
causing my dad's bankruptcy

14:35.830 --> 14:37.480
and leaving him with a huge debt.

14:37.480 --> 14:38.510
Later, my dad

14:38.840 --> 14:40.660
died of depression.

14:43.510 --> 14:44.370
Director Wang,

14:44.800 --> 14:46.210
I really want to help you.

14:46.670 --> 14:47.750
That's like

14:47.750 --> 14:49.150
helping my father.

14:50.330 --> 14:52.200
Stop lying.

14:53.240 --> 14:54.000
I know

14:55.550 --> 14:56.320
you are a member of

14:56.320 --> 14:57.390
Lan Yue Group.

14:58.000 --> 14:58.630
That day,

14:58.870 --> 15:00.630
the one who followed you to my home

15:00.630 --> 15:02.000
was Lu Zhongyue's son.

15:02.540 --> 15:03.350
Now,

15:03.690 --> 15:05.300
do you have any more excuses?

15:05.830 --> 15:07.650
If you really want to help me,

15:08.090 --> 15:09.190
let me ask you.

15:09.790 --> 15:11.240
Where is the evidence

15:11.240 --> 15:12.000
I gave you?

15:12.730 --> 15:14.440
I can explain it.

15:15.010 --> 15:15.640
I can also

15:15.670 --> 15:16.320
get it back.

15:16.320 --> 15:17.200
I promise you.

15:17.480 --> 15:18.280
It's too late.

15:19.160 --> 15:21.100
Do you think I'll trust you again?

15:21.120 --> 15:22.390
That evidence

15:22.600 --> 15:23.320
might be

15:23.320 --> 15:24.840
in Lu Zhongyue's hands.

15:25.540 --> 15:27.520
I have nothing now.

15:30.680 --> 15:32.940
Director Wang, calm down.

15:33.120 --> 15:33.780
Think about it.

15:33.780 --> 15:35.920
You have Lili.

15:36.150 --> 15:37.390
Let's help the factory

15:37.390 --> 15:38.540
get back to normal.

15:38.630 --> 15:39.510
Shut up!

15:39.960 --> 15:41.690
Director Wang! Director Wang!

15:42.960 --> 15:44.120
Shut up!

15:44.600 --> 15:45.510
Listen.

15:45.600 --> 15:47.630
You don't deserve to
mention my daughter's name.

15:47.630 --> 15:48.440
I have prepared

15:48.440 --> 15:49.630
the evidence.

15:49.670 --> 15:51.270
and written my suicide note.

15:51.730 --> 15:54.610
I believe the police will be able to

15:54.630 --> 15:56.550
find out what Lu Zhongyue has done!

15:56.550 --> 15:57.320
Zhou Wan!

15:58.240 --> 15:58.840
Zhou Wan!

16:04.910 --> 16:05.550
Zhou Wan!

16:06.670 --> 16:07.480
Zhou Wan!

16:08.570 --> 16:10.530
Stop! Don't come over!

16:16.240 --> 16:17.940
You must be Lu Zhongyue's son.

16:18.130 --> 16:19.330
You came just in time.

16:19.480 --> 16:20.740
I will let Lu Zhongyue taste

16:20.740 --> 16:22.740
the feelings of losing everything.

16:25.330 --> 16:26.280
Calm down.

16:26.300 --> 16:27.090
Director Wang,

16:27.090 --> 16:28.860
please calm down and think it over.

16:28.860 --> 16:30.620
I'm Lu Zhongyue's son.

16:30.910 --> 16:32.240
If you need anything,

16:32.270 --> 16:33.510
you can threaten him

16:33.510 --> 16:34.390
with me.

16:34.410 --> 16:35.120
Hurting Zhou Wan

16:35.120 --> 16:35.870
is no help

16:35.870 --> 16:37.360
to you now.

16:43.070 --> 16:44.470
Think about your mother.

16:44.700 --> 16:45.750
Think about Lili.

16:46.260 --> 16:47.910
Let Lan Yue explain

16:47.910 --> 16:49.200
the incident of the furniture factory
for you.

16:49.200 --> 16:50.890
You don't have to hide anymore.

16:50.890 --> 16:51.980
Your mom and daughter can live

16:51.980 --> 16:53.460
a safe and sound life.

16:53.920 --> 16:55.240
As long as you don't hurt Zhou Wan,

16:55.240 --> 16:56.030
I can cooperate with you

16:56.030 --> 16:56.870
to do anything.

16:56.870 --> 16:58.670
I'll do anything you ask me to do.

17:03.750 --> 17:05.089
Let me see her first.

17:05.220 --> 17:06.599
Let me know she's safe.

17:06.750 --> 17:07.400
Okay?

17:07.470 --> 17:08.349
Alright.

17:08.349 --> 17:09.750
It's useless to say this.

17:09.869 --> 17:10.800
Don't come over!

17:14.440 --> 17:15.510
Turn around.

17:17.329 --> 17:18.290
Turn around!

17:27.540 --> 17:29.340
Put both hands behind your back!

17:47.350 --> 17:47.880
Zhou Wan!

17:48.590 --> 17:49.490
Are you okay?

17:49.520 --> 17:50.920
-Are you hurt?
-Are you okay?

17:50.920 --> 17:51.920
How dare you fool me?

17:51.920 --> 17:53.580
I shouldn't have trusted you!

17:53.750 --> 17:54.880
Go to hell together!

17:55.720 --> 17:56.920
Let's end everything

17:57.440 --> 17:58.480
and see who can survive

17:58.480 --> 17:59.610
and live a good life.

18:08.500 --> 18:09.160
How are you?

18:09.450 --> 18:10.350
Are you hurt?

18:11.830 --> 18:13.280
None of you can escape!

18:26.400 --> 18:27.310
Are you okay?

18:29.160 --> 18:29.960
Your arm...

18:32.160 --> 18:33.210
I'm fine.

18:37.080 --> 18:39.030
I was just in time.

18:47.110 --> 18:47.750
Thanks.

18:52.360 --> 18:53.010
Recently,

18:53.160 --> 18:55.070
Wang, the owner of
Yinshan Furniture Factory,

18:55.070 --> 18:56.730
was arrested for kidnapping.

18:57.160 --> 18:58.830
Wang claimed that his factory

18:58.830 --> 19:00.480
went bankrupt

19:00.480 --> 19:01.960
due to malicious competition.

19:01.960 --> 19:03.480
The police are currently

19:03.480 --> 19:04.680
investigating related cases.

19:04.680 --> 19:05.790
Don't move.

19:05.790 --> 19:06.920
Stay still.

19:06.940 --> 19:08.830
No, my legs are too long.

19:09.480 --> 19:10.400
I can't stretch.

19:10.400 --> 19:11.640
I mean your arm.

19:16.110 --> 19:17.110
Be careful

19:17.110 --> 19:18.000
when you take a shower.

19:18.000 --> 19:19.530
Don't let the wound get wet.

19:19.770 --> 19:21.190
I can't guarantee that.

19:21.590 --> 19:23.120
Because I hurt my right arm.

19:29.320 --> 19:31.440
Your arm is not broken.

19:31.850 --> 19:33.680
I've sealed it for you.

19:33.680 --> 19:35.080
Everything will be fine.

19:37.240 --> 19:38.240
Turn around.

19:44.790 --> 19:45.680
Seems your injury

19:45.680 --> 19:47.270
is completely fine.

19:47.750 --> 19:49.270
I worried for nothing.

19:49.590 --> 19:50.440
How is that possible?

19:50.440 --> 19:51.240
My arm

19:51.240 --> 19:52.680
still hurts.

19:54.200 --> 19:55.260
Put your hand down.

19:55.510 --> 19:56.460
Who made you do...

19:56.460 --> 19:58.790
That's because you're good at bandaging.

19:59.270 --> 19:59.830
My wound

19:59.830 --> 20:00.920
didn't get wet.

20:02.880 --> 20:03.880
Really.

20:05.270 --> 20:06.510
My arm is still…

20:07.310 --> 20:08.640
It's just a lift that I…

20:08.640 --> 20:10.640
Why didn't you stop moving your arm?

20:11.790 --> 20:13.500
You're acting again.

20:13.590 --> 20:13.880
Hey.

20:13.880 --> 20:15.550
-Do you want me to blow-dry your hair?
-It hurts. It hurts.

20:15.550 --> 20:16.790
-Ouch!
-I'll stop right now.

20:16.790 --> 20:17.520
I need you to blow-dry my hair.

20:17.520 --> 20:18.590
Continue. Continue, please.

20:18.590 --> 20:20.030
-No.
-Continue, please.

20:20.030 --> 20:21.070
Let's stop here.

20:22.310 --> 20:23.400
I'm impatient.

20:25.680 --> 20:26.510
Don't leave.

20:26.510 --> 20:27.440
Don't leave.

20:27.680 --> 20:29.280
I have something to tell you.

20:29.520 --> 20:30.580
Are you going to...

20:31.240 --> 20:32.270
No.

20:33.330 --> 20:34.440
I have something to tell you.

20:34.440 --> 20:34.960
Really.

20:36.020 --> 20:36.870
Go ahead.

20:37.750 --> 20:38.960
Wang Yongli

20:40.540 --> 20:42.470
is now facing criminal charges.

20:43.880 --> 20:44.720
But he can still

20:44.720 --> 20:46.070
sue Lan Yue.

20:48.270 --> 20:49.440
And

20:50.510 --> 20:51.590
I've found

20:51.590 --> 20:52.270
more evidence of

20:52.270 --> 20:54.730
the incident of Yinshan Furniture Factory.

20:55.880 --> 20:57.240
Together with the evidence

20:57.240 --> 20:58.310
Jiang Yan left,

20:59.070 --> 21:00.510
the truth of
the Yinshan Furniture Factory

21:00.510 --> 21:02.000
will be revealed, right?

21:06.200 --> 21:07.730
There's a piece of bad news.

21:08.070 --> 21:10.000
The supplier who cheated your dad,

21:10.120 --> 21:11.320
whose surname is Huo,

21:12.090 --> 21:13.350
died in a car accident.

21:20.640 --> 21:21.920
So, it means

21:22.440 --> 21:23.830
we have no clue here.

21:25.260 --> 21:26.000
Even if we can

21:26.000 --> 21:27.310
win the lawsuit,

21:28.790 --> 21:30.070
we still can't prove

21:30.070 --> 21:31.870
what Lu Zhongyue did to your dad.

21:35.750 --> 21:37.240
I know it's hard

21:38.070 --> 21:40.870
to hold someone accountable
for my dad's tragedy.

21:45.030 --> 21:45.830
But it's okay

21:46.830 --> 21:48.680
as long as Lu Zhongyue's misconduct

21:48.680 --> 21:49.830
can be exposed.

22:04.680 --> 22:05.270
It's me.

22:05.830 --> 22:06.960
I saw the news.

22:07.310 --> 22:08.200
Let's meet.

22:43.880 --> 22:45.080
You've changed a lot.

22:45.880 --> 22:47.000
You are mature.

22:50.000 --> 22:52.000
This is the coffee I ordered for you.

22:56.550 --> 22:58.000
What do you want from me?

22:58.510 --> 22:59.270
I have nothing

22:59.270 --> 23:00.070
to talk to you.

23:20.030 --> 23:20.890
This is for you.

23:22.270 --> 23:23.000
Take a look.

23:30.640 --> 23:31.830
You've been working hard

23:30.800 --> 23:32.240
[About Jun'an Building Materials Factory]

23:31.830 --> 23:33.070
for so many years

23:32.240 --> 23:33.690
[and
Hengguan Hardware
and Building Materials Co., Ltd]

23:33.440 --> 23:34.680
for this, right?

23:33.720 --> 23:36.880
[Correspondence and Handling Records
Regarding Raw Material Quality Disputes]

23:39.480 --> 23:41.550
I handled all these at that time.

23:42.680 --> 23:45.200
There is some evidence

23:45.270 --> 23:47.600
left by the material factory
and dealers.

23:49.160 --> 23:50.480
I just wanted

23:50.480 --> 23:52.160
to leave myself a way out.

23:54.400 --> 23:56.680
Now, I don't need it anymore.

23:57.350 --> 23:59.590
I've thought a lot these years.

24:02.200 --> 24:03.990
I want to live a different life.

24:08.290 --> 24:09.440
Why did you help me?

24:15.830 --> 24:18.310
I didn't expect you

24:18.510 --> 24:20.370
to keep investigating the truth.

24:21.790 --> 24:22.550
I always thought

24:22.550 --> 24:24.280
we were the same kind of people.

24:25.270 --> 24:26.200
But

24:26.960 --> 24:28.560
I just figured it out now that

24:31.270 --> 24:32.750
scheming everything

24:33.400 --> 24:34.790
and trying your best

24:35.400 --> 24:36.480
are different.

24:38.790 --> 24:40.050
You are doing well now,

24:41.830 --> 24:42.690
better than me.

24:48.810 --> 24:49.720
Good.

24:50.480 --> 24:52.310
My daughter, may you be happy.

24:52.480 --> 24:54.350
I'll let you pay the bill.

24:54.880 --> 24:55.810
You're welcome.

25:28.930 --> 25:31.060
You really don't need me to go with you?

25:35.250 --> 25:36.540
Didn't we agree that?

25:37.400 --> 25:39.060
It's related to the Lu family.

25:39.700 --> 25:41.900
I don't want to make you uncomfortable.

25:55.520 --> 25:56.240
Well,

25:58.340 --> 25:59.740
I'll wait for you at home.

26:07.480 --> 26:08.280
This matter

26:08.310 --> 26:09.830
has caused a stir,

26:10.070 --> 26:11.460
creating a bad influence

26:11.460 --> 26:12.810
on our company.

26:14.160 --> 26:16.590
Someone has to be responsible

26:16.830 --> 26:17.920
for this.

26:19.070 --> 26:19.960
Mr. Lu,

26:20.590 --> 26:22.160
to be precise,

26:22.160 --> 26:23.200
it was because of

26:23.200 --> 26:25.880
the malicious intent of the acquisition
of Yinshan Furniture Factory.

26:25.880 --> 26:26.510
Xixiao and the others

26:26.510 --> 26:27.830
went to do a routine inspection

26:27.830 --> 26:29.560
but suffered extreme revenge.

26:29.590 --> 26:30.510
No matter what,

26:30.830 --> 26:31.720
they should not

26:31.740 --> 26:32.660
be blamed.

26:33.070 --> 26:34.000
Don't you think

26:34.000 --> 26:35.680
you're beating around the bush?

26:35.680 --> 26:37.480
As for the incident of
Yinshan Furniture Factory,

26:37.480 --> 26:39.160
there are some tumors.

26:39.590 --> 26:40.680
How could a villain's words

26:40.680 --> 26:41.790
be credible?

26:43.480 --> 26:44.110
That's just slander from

26:44.110 --> 26:46.160
a desperate man.

26:46.830 --> 26:48.030
But those who in charge of the project

26:48.030 --> 26:49.270
of the company

26:50.200 --> 26:51.440
disregarded the company's interests

26:51.440 --> 26:52.200
and acted without permission,

26:52.200 --> 26:53.750
causing such a big trouble.

26:54.240 --> 26:57.070
I suggest we dismiss them
as soon as possible.

27:00.070 --> 27:01.270
Mr. Lu, don't bother.

27:02.440 --> 27:03.700
I'll resign right now.

27:04.310 --> 27:05.640
This is the meeting of
the board of directors.

27:05.640 --> 27:06.790
You're not qualified
to attend the meeting.

27:06.790 --> 27:08.070
I invited Miss Zhou

27:08.070 --> 27:08.790
especially

27:08.790 --> 27:10.510
as the witness of the incident.

27:10.510 --> 27:11.680
Let's listen to

27:11.680 --> 27:13.000
what she wants to say.

27:13.240 --> 27:14.550
What do you think?

27:14.680 --> 27:15.480
What do you mean?

27:15.480 --> 27:17.410
-This is the meeting of...
-Mr. Lu.

27:18.480 --> 27:19.270
When senior Mr. Lu

27:19.270 --> 27:20.070
heard this incident,

27:20.070 --> 27:21.070
he was very angry.

27:21.240 --> 27:21.830
He asked me

27:21.830 --> 27:23.890
to hold a board meeting immediately.

27:24.440 --> 27:25.110
I think

27:25.240 --> 27:27.270
he wants to hear

27:27.270 --> 27:29.270
the story from the person involved.

27:29.510 --> 27:30.200
Mr. Lu,

27:31.070 --> 27:32.070
what do you think?

27:36.510 --> 27:39.780
[Meeting of Chairman No.78
of Lan Yue Group]

27:41.400 --> 27:42.110
I'm sorry.

27:42.480 --> 27:43.400
I can't continue to be in charge of

27:43.400 --> 27:45.130
the Phase II project of Lan Yue.

27:45.400 --> 27:46.070
Sorry for making trouble

27:46.070 --> 27:47.400
for you and Ms. Qilan.

27:48.680 --> 27:49.680
Before I leave,

27:49.750 --> 27:51.240
I have sent two important documents

27:51.240 --> 27:52.110
to you

27:52.200 --> 27:53.590
via email.

27:53.720 --> 27:54.780
Please check them.

28:00.430 --> 28:00.740
[Yinshan Furniture Quality Issue]

28:01.310 --> 28:02.070
The first one

28:02.200 --> 28:04.240
is the evidence of

28:04.090 --> 28:07.820
[Yinshan Furniture Quality Issue]

28:04.240 --> 28:05.790
sabotaging business operations

28:05.790 --> 28:07.160
and conducting contract fraud

28:07.160 --> 28:09.310
in the process of purchasing
the land

28:09.310 --> 28:11.270
of the Phase II project of Lan Yue.

28:11.680 --> 28:12.680
Before Yinshan Furniture Factory

28:12.680 --> 28:13.790
was acquired,

28:13.900 --> 28:14.960
the factory director, Wang Yongli,

28:14.020 --> 28:16.600
[Yinshan Furniture Quality Issue]

28:14.960 --> 28:16.800
was sued

28:17.070 --> 28:18.730
for using inferior products,

28:19.030 --> 28:21.000
and then, the factory closed down.

28:21.230 --> 28:22.560
But in fact,

28:21.950 --> 28:25.690
[Yinshan Furniture Quality Issue]

28:23.070 --> 28:24.790
it was because the purchaser of

28:24.790 --> 28:26.000
Yinshan Furniture Factory

28:26.000 --> 28:27.960
and the dealers

28:27.960 --> 28:29.070
who provided raw materials
colluded secretly

28:29.070 --> 28:30.640
to forge the quality inspection report,

28:30.640 --> 28:32.000
leading to

28:32.000 --> 28:33.070
product quality issues.

28:33.070 --> 28:34.880
Thus, Wang Yongli

28:34.880 --> 28:36.500
was forced to transfer the land

28:36.500 --> 28:38.180
to Lan Yue at a very low price.

28:38.370 --> 28:39.650
Cut the crap.

28:39.680 --> 28:41.070
What nonsense are you talking about?

28:41.070 --> 28:42.400
-Mr. Lu.
-You must...

28:43.200 --> 28:44.680
Behave yourself.

28:45.270 --> 28:46.070
Have a seat.

28:53.270 --> 28:54.270
Coincidentally,

28:54.530 --> 28:55.040
[Yinshan Furniture Quality Issue]

28:54.960 --> 28:56.070
you did the same thing

28:55.070 --> 28:58.060
[Product Quality Issue
of Jun'an Construction]

28:56.480 --> 28:57.960
20 years ago.

28:59.270 --> 29:00.830
Do you remember

29:01.270 --> 29:03.330
Jun'an Building Materials Factory?

29:04.310 --> 29:06.680
During the purchase of the land of

29:06.680 --> 29:08.740
Lan Yue Phase I project of the resort,

29:08.750 --> 29:10.960
Lu Zhongyue set up a trap with the dealer

29:11.590 --> 29:12.880
in the same way,

29:12.900 --> 29:15.150
causing Jun'an's bankruptcy.

29:15.350 --> 29:18.280
In this way, it was purchased
by Lan Yue at a low price.

29:19.310 --> 29:20.310
For 20 years,

29:21.690 --> 29:23.210
many families

29:24.070 --> 29:25.070
have been

29:26.270 --> 29:27.640
driven to destitution,

29:29.270 --> 29:30.510
and ruined

29:32.680 --> 29:33.830
due to you.

29:36.400 --> 29:38.200
I know, for you,

29:39.270 --> 29:40.160
it's just

29:40.160 --> 29:41.440
a dirty deal.

29:43.830 --> 29:45.030
But for people

29:45.030 --> 29:46.490
who experienced all this,

29:47.790 --> 29:49.590
they've waited for the truth

29:50.310 --> 29:52.400
for 20 years.

29:55.590 --> 29:57.120
The materials in your hands

29:57.680 --> 29:58.680
have also been sent

29:58.680 --> 29:59.960
to relevant departments.

29:59.960 --> 30:01.400
I believe someone will

30:01.400 --> 30:02.510
come to investigate it.

30:02.510 --> 30:03.830
Lan Yue is a leading enterprise

30:03.830 --> 30:04.750
in Pingchuan.

30:05.240 --> 30:06.990
I believe its development

30:07.330 --> 30:09.860
relies on upholding integrity
in operations

30:10.270 --> 30:11.730
and putting people first.

30:12.200 --> 30:13.510
I believe all of you

30:14.270 --> 30:15.110
will make a proper choice

30:15.110 --> 30:16.830
for the long-term development

30:16.830 --> 30:18.350
of Lan Yue.

30:19.250 --> 30:22.850
[Product Quality Issue
of Jun'an Construction]

30:26.690 --> 30:29.980
[Product Quality Issue
of Jun'an Construction]

30:30.680 --> 30:31.680
By the way, Mr. Lu,

30:32.540 --> 30:33.730
do you remember

30:34.440 --> 30:36.030
the name of the director

30:36.030 --> 30:38.230
of Jun'an Building Materials Factory?

30:39.830 --> 30:40.960
His name is Zhou Jun.

30:56.850 --> 30:57.740
Dad.

30:57.930 --> 30:59.000
Lu Zhongyue has been punished

30:59.000 --> 31:00.070
by the law.

31:00.960 --> 31:01.640
The truth

31:02.200 --> 31:03.400
is finally revealed.

31:37.930 --> 31:40.550
♪ Fast footsteps ♪

31:40.940 --> 31:43.440
♪ When we just stepped out,
we didn't meet ♪

31:43.460 --> 31:45.920
♪ Yet already in impatience ♪

31:46.180 --> 31:50.040
♪ In the air after the rain ♪

31:50.060 --> 31:53.860
♪ Everything is filled with joy ♪

31:52.900 --> 31:59.090
[Lan Yue Group]

32:00.410 --> 32:02.330
♪ Your whisper ♪

32:02.900 --> 32:04.770
♪ Is in sync with ♪

32:04.790 --> 32:08.190
♪ My breath ♪

32:08.460 --> 32:12.090
♪ You seem to have heard ♪

32:12.120 --> 32:15.010
♪ The unspoken loneliness ♪

32:15.190 --> 32:20.340
♪ And the feelings I dare not say ♪

32:22.000 --> 32:27.650
♪ Let me sink into the time
when you are here ♪

32:27.670 --> 32:31.050
♪ This world is always too cruel ♪

32:31.210 --> 32:36.600
♪ With you here,
I can honestly admit my expectations ♪

32:36.630 --> 32:39.200
♪ Beyond what I had imagined ♪

32:54.120 --> 32:56.630
Xixiao, I told you

32:56.650 --> 32:58.570
she is not the right fit for you.

32:59.310 --> 33:00.270
Why are you

33:00.270 --> 33:01.440
so stubborn?

33:13.680 --> 33:14.310
Grandpa,

33:16.890 --> 33:17.880
you should know

33:18.500 --> 33:20.300
I'm different from Lu Zhongyue.

33:20.680 --> 33:22.070
I don't need someone like my mom

33:22.070 --> 33:23.160
to be with me,

33:23.200 --> 33:24.880
and guide me every day

33:24.880 --> 33:26.410
to keep me on the right path.

33:27.440 --> 33:28.440
All I've done these years

33:28.440 --> 33:29.640
has proved it.

33:29.640 --> 33:30.550
I've grown up.

33:30.710 --> 33:31.160
I can call the shots

33:31.160 --> 33:32.480
in my life.

33:34.140 --> 33:35.440
I don't care about

33:35.440 --> 33:37.160
others' opinions and comments.

33:37.160 --> 33:37.960
So, you don't have to

33:37.960 --> 33:39.180
threaten her with these things

33:39.180 --> 33:41.380
and force her to put herself in my shoes.

33:41.510 --> 33:42.990
I know what I want.

33:43.590 --> 33:44.590
I also know

33:44.590 --> 33:45.640
what I can do.

33:53.670 --> 33:54.470
This matter

33:54.960 --> 33:56.310
is between us.

33:57.270 --> 33:59.200
I was young, immature,

33:59.200 --> 34:00.920
and childish. I had no say.

34:00.940 --> 34:02.000
So, I had no choice.

34:02.040 --> 34:03.160
But whether I forgive her now

34:03.160 --> 34:04.240
or not

34:05.270 --> 34:06.310
depends on me.

34:07.400 --> 34:08.760
The agreement you made with her

34:08.760 --> 34:10.080
doesn't count anymore.

34:10.080 --> 34:11.230
You told her not to show up

34:11.230 --> 34:12.070
in front of me anymore

34:12.070 --> 34:14.000
but never asked about my opinions.

34:14.080 --> 34:14.670
Grandpa,

34:15.500 --> 34:16.580
it's not fair.

34:17.239 --> 34:19.440
You've always had a keen eye for people.

34:19.670 --> 34:20.670
It's not simply a matter

34:20.670 --> 34:21.670
of whether two people

34:21.670 --> 34:23.280
are right for each other

34:23.280 --> 34:24.280
or not.

34:25.130 --> 34:26.790
Look at my mom and Lu Zhongyue.

34:27.100 --> 34:27.760
If they had

34:27.760 --> 34:28.840
divorced,

34:29.190 --> 34:31.670
all these tragedies
wouldn't have happened.

34:31.670 --> 34:32.230
I really hope

34:32.230 --> 34:33.179
the Lu family

34:33.440 --> 34:34.239
can be warmer.

34:34.320 --> 34:34.880
So, grandpa,

34:34.880 --> 34:35.670
what I want to tell you

34:35.670 --> 34:36.590
is very simple.

34:38.199 --> 34:40.130
I only have feelings with Zhou Wan.

34:41.150 --> 34:42.630
All these years,

34:43.150 --> 34:44.510
she is my only love.

34:47.550 --> 34:48.630
She made me feel

34:51.280 --> 34:52.070
the world

34:52.070 --> 34:53.000
is interesting.

34:58.320 --> 34:59.380
So, except for her,

35:00.550 --> 35:01.680
I don't want anyone.

35:04.320 --> 35:06.160
From the very beginning,

35:06.180 --> 35:07.550
she had ulterior motives.

35:07.550 --> 35:08.590
She utilized you.

35:09.320 --> 35:10.030
Don't you care about that?

35:10.030 --> 35:10.880
I don't care.

35:12.850 --> 35:13.440
I told you.

35:13.440 --> 35:15.070
As long as I am with her,

35:15.910 --> 35:17.510
no matter what difficulties

35:17.630 --> 35:19.360
and setbacks I will encounter,

35:20.320 --> 35:21.440
I will accept them.

35:41.180 --> 35:41.890
Let me do it.

35:49.130 --> 35:49.780
Sit down.

35:57.110 --> 35:57.920
Have some tea.

36:08.670 --> 36:10.150
Jiang Fan, open the door.

36:10.210 --> 36:11.280
The agent called me.

36:11.280 --> 36:12.230
He said you didn't answer his calls

36:12.230 --> 36:12.880
or hand over the house to him.

36:12.880 --> 36:14.080
What do you want to do?

36:15.030 --> 36:15.830
Open the door!

37:01.170 --> 37:03.170
It is my first time visiting a house.

37:05.280 --> 37:06.470
-It’s so big.
-Do you like it?

37:06.470 --> 37:07.320
This is exactly

37:07.320 --> 37:08.500
my dream kitchen.

37:08.800 --> 37:10.110
We can place

37:10.110 --> 37:11.430
a six-person table here.

37:11.430 --> 37:11.880
Then, when Wan

37:11.880 --> 37:12.670
and my parents come here,

37:12.670 --> 37:13.880
they can eat here.

37:13.900 --> 37:14.450
Okay.

37:15.670 --> 37:16.590
Let's

37:16.630 --> 37:17.760
put a wine cabinet here.

37:17.760 --> 37:18.190
Honey.

37:18.190 --> 37:19.320
I also want to

37:19.320 --> 37:20.920
put the dolls in the cabinet.

37:21.340 --> 37:28.530
[Filming]

37:22.630 --> 37:23.230
Okay.

37:25.320 --> 37:26.590
The TV wall is so big.

37:26.630 --> 37:28.030
Don't install a TV.

37:28.150 --> 37:29.440
-Let's install...
-A projection screen.

37:29.440 --> 37:30.150
I know.

37:30.150 --> 37:31.070
I'll edit all the materials

37:31.070 --> 37:32.510
we filmed

37:32.590 --> 37:33.280
and show the videos on the screen.

37:32.670 --> 37:36.420
[Filming]

37:35.490 --> 37:36.660
You're clever.

37:39.150 --> 37:40.280
But I don't like the curtains.

37:40.280 --> 37:40.710
Honey,

37:40.730 --> 37:42.400
I would like to change the curtains
to warm colors.

37:42.400 --> 37:43.930
Cream-colored ones, okay?

37:44.440 --> 37:45.710
Let's buy

37:45.710 --> 37:46.630
all the warm colors.

37:46.630 --> 37:48.440
Okay. Cream-colored ones are okay.

37:48.440 --> 37:50.300
